# Mobile UI consistency (PHI)

When adding or editing mobile screens, follow the established design system. Do not introduce one-off styles, emoji icons, or raw `ActivityIndicator` spinners on full screens.

## Design tokens

Import from `mobile/lib/theme.ts` only — never hardcode hex colors or spacing:

- **Colors:** `colors.primary` (teal accent), `colors.text`, `colors.textMuted`, semantic `danger`/`success`/`warning`
- **Spacing:** `spacing.sm` (8), `spacing.md` (16), `spacing.lg` (24)
- **Radii:** `radii.md` (12), `radii.lg` (16)
- **Typography:** `typography.hero`, `typography.title`, `typography.body`, `typography.data` (tabular nums for biomarkers)

One accent color per view. Teal is for primary actions and active nav only.

## Shared components (`mobile/components/ui/`)

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Page layout + scroll | `Screen` |
| Elevated surface | `Card` (variants: default, muted, outlined, accent) |
| Primary/secondary action | `Button` (never raw `Pressable` for CTAs) |
| Status chip | `Badge` |
| Icon | `Icon` from `@expo/vector-icons` via `Icon` wrapper |
| Tappable card/row | `AnimatedPressable` |
| Staggered entrance | `FadeInView` with `delay` |
| Loading placeholder | `Skeleton` / `SkeletonCard` |
| Empty list | `EmptyState` with icon + one CTA |
| Modal sheet | `BottomSheet` |

Import from `../../components/ui` (or `../components/ui` from `app/`).

## Icons

- Use `Icon` with Ionicons names — **never emoji** for navigation or actions
- Nav icon map lives in `mobile/lib/icons.ts` (`navIcons`)
- Sizes: `iconSize.sm` (18), `md` (22), `lg` (28), `xl` (40)

## Motion

- Press feedback: `AnimatedPressable` (scale 0.97, spring)
- Screen sections: `FadeInView` with staggered `delay` (0, 60, 120…)
- Animate only `transform` and `opacity` — no layout property animation
- Keep interaction feedback under 200ms

## Text in pressables

All visible text inside `AnimatedPressable` or `Button` must be in `<Text>`. Use template strings for dynamic labels:

```tsx
// Good
<Button>{`Switch to ${mode}`}</Button>

// Also good — Button wraps text-only children automatically
<Button>Switch to {mode}</Button>

// Bad — raw string as direct child of View/Animated.View
<AnimatedPressable><Text>Label</Text></AnimatedPressable> // OK
<AnimatedPressable>Label</AnimatedPressable> // ERROR
```

## Loading & errors

- Full-screen loading: `SkeletonCard` rows, not centered spinners
- Inline errors: `Card variant="outlined"` with `Icon name="alert-circle-outline"` + message
- API auth failures (401/403): return empty data gracefully, don't surface as uncaught errors

